ret a percentage in relation to the current value, such as 200 + 10% = 220.","recommended":true},{"id":"literal_divide_by_100","label":"Literal percentage value","description":"Interpret 10% strictly as 0.1, without calculator-style relative-operation behavior.","recommended":false}]},{"id":"verifier_evidence","prompt":"Please provide the failing verifier evidence, including the failing input, expected result, actual result, and relevant error output.","rationale":"The request requires the fix to be based on verifier evidence, but none is available in the supplied context.","kind":"validation","options":[]}],"assumptions":[]}}
